# .private-prefixes — your own numbers, kept off the repository.
#
# Copy this file to `.private-prefixes` (gitignored) and put your own phone
# prefixes on separate lines. scripts/scan-secrets.js refuses any commit whose
# staged content contains a number starting with one of them.
#
# The list is per person, not per repo: it is how the scanner can protect your
# family's and your friends' numbers without this project ever knowing them.
#
#   # home country, mobile
#   9230
#   # a friend abroad
#   447700
#
# A prefix of four digits or more is required (shorter would match everything).
